// canonicalCisCardFunctionInfo, and what only it reaches
//
// One function of a PC Card as its CIS describes it, in a
// canonicalSocketInfo's cisFunctions (src/pcmcia/CardInfo.cpp): the function
// id (-1 for none) and its extension tuples.

canonicalCisCardFunctionInfo := {cisFunctionId: -1, cisFunctionExts: [|Array|: ]};
